Comment: 0,0:00:18.64,0:00:21.79,translation **,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Lovely, lovely, lovely, lovely
Comment: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:21.49,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Chu chu chu!
Comment: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:39.36,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Stuck in a world of liberty—one which not a soul can see
Comment: 0,0:00:39.69,0:00:43.78,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Though, definitely, realbooting it is a no-go
Comment: 0,0:00:43.75,0:00:44.60,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}No-go
Comment: 0,0:00:44.22,0:00:50.01,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Y’all normie corps soldiers and lovebirds, please go explode...
Comment: 0,0:00:49.68,0:00:50.50,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Kaboom!
Comment: 0,0:00:50.14,0:00:54.35,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Noah's Ark, I beg you porters!
Comment: 0,0:00:54.72,0:01:00.52,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Let your biorhythm rise and Gigaloma-nize away
Comment: 0,0:01:00.28,0:01:00.82,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Yay!
Comment: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:04.88,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}3D and 2D shall now become one!
Comment: 0,0:01:04.88,0:01:08.41,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Three, two, one, go!
Comment: 0,0:01:05.92,0:01:08.41,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Chaos is the new you, Love Chu Chu!
Comment: 0,0:01:08.41,0:01:10.67,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Filling your head too with Love Chu Chu!
Comment: 0,0:01:09.95,0:01:10.76,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Chu Chu!
Comment: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:16.19,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}To this world of delusions we welcome you! Dive!
Comment: 0,0:01:15.90,0:01:16.56,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Let's go!
Comment: 0,0:01:16.37,0:01:20.43,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}It’s a chaotic generation, so let’s synchro with it!
Comment: 0,0:01:18.67,0:01:19.31,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Yay!
Comment: 0,0:01:20.43,0:01:26.16,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Within here, you can even become a god!
Comment: 0,0:01:21.27,0:01:21.80,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Boom!
